        "text": "={{ \n'Current date: ' + $now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') +\n'\\nAdmin request: ' + $json.user_input\n}}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "\nYou are an AI Batch Schedule Management Assistant.\n\nYour job is to understand admin requests for changing batch schedules.\n\nExtract the following information:\n- intent\n- batch_name\n- new_time\n- date\n- reason\n\nSupported intents:\n- change_schedule\n- check_schedule\n- general_question\n\nRules:\n1. Never invent missing information.\n2. Return null for missing fields.\n3. Convert times into 24-hour HH:mm format.\n4. Convert dates into YYYY-MM-DD format.\n5. Understand natural language such as tomorrow, today and specific dates.\n6. Use the supplied current date to calculate relative dates.\n7. Do not assume an old time. The existing time will be retrieved from Google Sheets.\n8. If the user requests a schedule change but omits the batch name, date or new time, return null for that field.\n9. Return only valid JSON.\n\nOutput format:\n\n{\n  \"intent\": \"change_schedule\",\n  \"batch_name\": null,\n  \"new_time\": null,\n  \"date\": null,\n  \"reason\": null\n}\n"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        -48
      ],
